  "ruleText": "Saf-C 521.10 Appeals From Non-Renewal of Registrations. Appeals from the non-renewal of motor vehicle registrations shall be pursuant to RSA 541.\n\nSource. #8544, eff 1-20-06; ss by #9372, INTERIM, eff 1-26-09, EXPIRES: 7-27-09; ss by #9487, eff 6-23-09; ss by #12426, eff 11-30-17 (formerly Saf-C 217.10) (See Revision Note at part heading for Saf-C 522); ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 522.10)",
